 "description": "Turn text or a link into a QR code. Returns a crisp SVG image and a data: URL you can drop into HTML or Markdown. Options: ecc (error correction L, M, Q, H), size in pixels, margin, dark and light colours (#hex). Up to 2,000 characters. Price: $0.001 in USDC per call (x402 or prepaid credits). In the free trial.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
